./docs/reviews/2026-07-22-mapd-companion-plan-gpt56sol.out:10:- Define snapshot fidelity precisely: cell representation must preserve blank cells, wide-character continuation state, effective/default colors, relevant attributes, cursor exclusion, viewport dimensions, and resize behavior. The current `ch + fg/bg/bold subset` is insufficient to guarantee terminal-equivalent rendering.
./docs/reviews/2026-07-22-mapd-companion-plan-gpt56sol.out:20:- Define accessibility behavior for canvas rendering and pin interaction, even if full mobile long-press remains C1.
./docs/reviews/2026-07-22-mapd-companion-plan-qwen38.out:22:- "基礎" zoom/pan accepted as "done" at scroll-only, then users complain; or over-built as pinch-zoom canvas, blowing C0 timeline.
